As I happened to be looking at this code just a few days ago when I posted a
patch to allow pets to follow other pets between levels...

The relevant code is in mondata.c, line 544, in the function 
levl_follower():

  /* monsters with the Amulet--even pets--won't follow across levels */
  if (mon_has_amulet(mtmp)) return FALSE;

When levl_follower() returns false, the monster won't follow you as you
move/levelport to a new level.

